  "schema:comment": "The Zenodo record states: \"The OCVs from LiNi0.5Mn1.5O4 (LNMO) electrodes vary depending on the degree of Mn/Ni disorder (see Sun et al.). The LNMO material used in this study targeted high Mn/Ni disorder, therefore the OCVs is a highly disordered spinel.\" No supplier, grade or product identifier is given for the powder, so none is stated here.",
